1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,610
Stop chasing MrBeast. Here is what it cost us.

2
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:14,400
On October 10, MrBeast came to Registan in Samarkand. Hundreds of fans surrounded him.

3
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,530
People pushed each other to get a photo.

4
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:24,640
Reports say some children fell and were at risk of being trampled.

5
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:29,330
Security barely got him out of the crowd.

6
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:35,570
MrBeast himself said over 1,000 people chased his car.

7
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:42,390
A Bukhara police official says MrBeast himself will not come to Bukhara.

8
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:45,990
Only his team is filming there.

9
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,350
This is not all of Uzbekistan.

10
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:53,640
But in front of a guest, some of us shamed ourselves.

11
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:57,420
We don't chase guests away. We welcome them.

